{"games":[{"id":6838795423,"name":"Warm Isolation","desc":"For information on why Warm Isolation now has a Restricted rating, see the post below:\nhttps://devforum.roblox.com/t/what-happened-to-warm-isolation/3920582?u=steven_scripts\n\nhang out with the guys and/or gals in a cozy bedroom\n\nIMPORTANT: Money and items don't save across servers. But if you get disconnected and still have a way to get back to the server you were in, don't worry! The server will keep your progress there for ten minutes before wiping it. (This does not apply if the last player in the server leaves, as that shuts down the server entirely.)\n\nIf a player is bothering you in any way, you can host a votekick on them by typing /votekick [Their username]. If successful, they will be kicked and banned from rejoining the server.\n\n- VIP servers are free!\n- In VIP servers you own, you can add songs to the MP3 player for free!\n- Players with premium get double starting salary!","path":"/game/6838795423-warm-isolation","slug":"6838795423-warm-isolation","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8eb514bb218bedde222047b06f29ee61e3f89fa2e63ce75586e4d52fd172c223.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-fa17c6c95e3e277b70d512d80d2edb3f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":71798107,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-09-07T02:47:05.910Z","creator":{"name":"Steven_Scripts","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6405807112,"name":"❄️ average plate gaem","desc":"the game has been closed for beta testing of what's next to come to apg. STAY TUNED!\n\n👑 average plate gaem 👑\n\na totally average game where you survive totally normal disasters... what could go wrong?\n\n😎 unlock sick powers to destroy your foes\n😈 sabotage your friends\n😱 can you survive the most chaotic rounds?\n\n🔨 join the community and check out social links for feature requests, bug reports, clips, and more!","path":"/game/6405807112-average-plate-gaem","slug":"64058